  "cell_contents": "Two MgSi(OH)6 formula units (28 atoms) in the primitive monoclinic P21 cell. All sites below are a fully occupied P21 positional-topology proxy from the Wunder et al. (2012) model crystal, rescaled to that study's high-precision experimental ambient lattice; the 2015 powder experiment used Le Bail refinement and did not refine atomic coordinates.",
